# Critical, not just for image size: locally-built node_modules/dist carry
# Windows-compiled native addons and stale build output that
# must not end up in the Linux image — apps/api/Dockerfile does a fresh
# `npm ci` + `turbo build` instead.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
build
**/build
.next
**/.next
.turbo

.git
coverage
*.tsbuildinfo

# Env files hold secrets (Strava/Garmin keys, the Railway connection string) —
# never bake them into an image layer. Only the committed examples get through.
.env*
**/.env*
!**/.env*.example

# Local databases (legacy garmy SQLite mirrors hold personal health data)
*.db
*.db-journal

.DS_Store
npm-debug.log*
